            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakabuzya kuti, Uli buti? Wakati, Mwaalumi munene nguwazwa, alimwi ulisamide cikobela. Mpawo Saulo wakaziba kuti ngu-Samuele, nkabela wakakotamika busyu bwakwe ansi akulemeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
