                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo wakafwambaana kuvundama amubili wakwe woonse ansi, wakayoowa loko nkaambo kamajwi aa-Samuele, takakacili anguzu pe, nkaambo taakwe ncaakalide buzuba obo boonse isikati amasiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
