                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele wakakaka, wakati, Pe, nsikoolya. Nekubaboobo balanda bakwe amwanakazi bakamukakatizya, elyo wakaswiilila majwi aabo, wakabuka ansi, wakakala abulo. ",
          "type": "text",
